      "widgets_values": [
        "✅ FINAL PROMPT (Kling / Omni)\n\nULTRA-REALISTIC STRICT BACKGROUND EXTENSION.\n\nABSOLUTE SOURCE LOCK (CRITICAL):\nThe original video must remain 100% unchanged in all visible foreground elements.\nDo NOT modify:\n\npeople (identity, pose, motion, clothing, shadows)\nground terrain and rocks\nlighting, exposure, color grading, contrast\ncamera angle, framing, lens perspective, composition\nNo regeneration, no relighting, no deformation, no flicker.\n\nTARGET AREA ONLY:\nModify ONLY the black empty sky/background area.\nAll non-black regions must remain pixel-identical to the original.\n\nBACKGROUND EXTENSION (DESERT LANDSCAPE):\nReplace the pure black background with a vast, ultra-realistic desert environment that seamlessly continues the existing ground.\n\nextend the rocky desert terrain naturally into the distance\nadd layered distant dunes and low rocky hills on the horizon\nmaintain the same ground color tone (warm reddish-brown)\nperfectly match perspective and horizon line with the original plate\nsubtle atmospheric depth (very light haze, no fog over foreground)\n\nSKY & ENVIRONMENT:\n\nnatural night sky OR very dark cinematic sky (NOT pitch black void)\nfaint stars allowed but very subtle (no sci-fi look)\nno surreal elements, no planets, no fantasy\n\nLIGHTING MATCH (VERY IMPORTANT):\n\nmatch original lighting direction and intensity\nno new light sources\nbackground must feel shot in same environment\nno color shift, no HDR exaggeration\n\nEDGE INTEGRATION:\n\nseamless blending at horizon line\nno halo, no edge artifacts\nno color spill mismatch\nnatural depth falloff\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT (STRICT):\nno character change, no duplication, no extra people\nno camera movement, no zoom, no pan\nno color grading change\nno stylization, no CGI look\nno blur, no noise, no banding\nno fantasy, no sci-fi objects"
      ],
